# Generated native projects.
#
# `expo prebuild` (and `expo run:ios` / `run:android`, which call it) writes these
# directories. They are build output, not source: this project is managed, the
# native config lives in app.config.ts, and the directories are regenerated from
# it. Committing them makes app.config.ts non-authoritative and the drift is
# invisible until a build picks the stale copy.
#
# Until this file existed, nothing ignored them — the "no ios/ in commits" rule
# was enforced only by whoever was paying attention at the time. One prebuild and
# one `git add -A` was all it took.
ios/
android/
